{"title":"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A large <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cube_(geometry)\" title=\"Cube (geometry)\"> cube</a> is painted green and then chopped up into 64 smaller congruent cubes. How many of the smaller cubes have at least one face painted green?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The cube is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/6/df6bd226f45d7767603f53041f10eac66d74a021.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\times 4\\times4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"71\" height=\"12\" />. Only the inside sub-cubes are unpainted, thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are unpainted, leaving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/a/a6ae1795ada2526cba9eaf8431f7a3f4d4973c25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64-8=56$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> painted.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST\">2005 Alabama ARML TST</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2